### Test Backend API Endpoints

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Root Endpoint  
GET http://localhost:3000/

### Register User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Test User",
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Login User
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "testuser@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Get Current User Profile (requires auth token)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Get User Schedules (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/schedule
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Create Schedule (requires auth)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/schedule
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test Schedule",
  "description": "A test schedule",
  "type": "TODO",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Get Collaboration Groups (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/collaboration/groups
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

### Get Focus Stats (requires auth)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/focus/stats
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
